    "summary": "Costs 1 CP. After an enemy picks its targets in the opposing [Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase) or either [Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase), pick one of its targets with **HERETIC ASTARTES**, excluding **DAMNED** units. Worsen AP by 1 on its attacks against your chosen unit until that attacker finishes. If [Empyric Dislocation](vsdata:ability/chaos-space-marines.warpstrike-champions.empyric-dislocation) targets a unit, [Armour of Corruption](vsdata:ability/chaos-space-marines.warpstrike-champions.armour-of-corruption) is unavailable to it that phase, and vice versa.",
